WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:07,440
Duanmu

2
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:08,900
Let Hei Furan send you up

3
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:10,620
Explore the general direction of Shilin

4
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:24,180
The same weird things are happening in all directions

5
00:00:24,830 --> 00:00:31,940
There is no end in sight at all, resting in place

6
00:00:32,620 --> 00:00:35,340
Observe the rise and fall patterns of dark flood objects and wait for two days before moving.

7
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:38,500
Wait two days

8
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:41,160
In two days, all the treasures would have been snatched away by other teams.

9
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,820
It's better not to get the treasure than to be trapped here forever.

10
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:48,580
Do you want to stay in the secret realm and be a savage for the rest of your life?
